codex
I found a substantive regression despite the polished text: the Go classifier equates `GoVersionRE` with the complete accepted Go version language. That regex accepts `go 1.23.4rc1`, but Go’s own `gover.Parse` rejects prereleases after an explicit patch; Go 1.25.1 and 1.25.5 both panic during `go mod tidy` on the submitted “permitted” vector. I’m finishing the full gate run and checking whether this is isolated or part of a broader classifier contradiction.
